<!-- Foreground alpha of the *folder* page's post-commit back exit.

     This resource exists only for the album grid -> home return. The settings, theme
     and custom-photo-profile pages keep the shared oxygen_classic_page_back_alpha curve.

     Why the folder page needs its own curve
     =======================================
     With OxygenClassicPageBackWindow the Shell selects
     CustomCrossActivityBackAnimation, which freezes the closing rect at the release
     position and keeps the entering parent on a full-screen base rect with alpha pinned
     to 1. The parent is therefore already fully composed underneath, so every frame of
     foreground alpha is a literal cross-dissolve of two grids.

     Phase-2 report (2026-11-24 device run): the album return was still read as
     "叠加溶解" - two image grids visible at once for too long - and the settings/custom
     profile returns as "提交后动画感觉缓慢" because their foreground had already gone
     while the window kept the clock. The folder page therefore gets a shorter clock
     (220 ms, see oxygen_classic_folder_back_duration_ms) *and* a steeper dissolve than
     the phase-1 curve: at 40% of the clock the foreground is at 0.39 alpha and 56% of
     its travel (phase 1: 0.56 alpha at 47% travel).

     Shape of this curve (y = fade fraction, alpha = 1 - y)
     ======================================================
     - y grows slowly at first (~0.06 by 10%), so the release frame keeps its opacity
       and the first part of the exit is motion, not dissolve;
     - the steepest part sits between 30% and 60%, where the paired slide curve is
       moving fastest, so the dissolve happens while the page is visibly leaving;
     - y reaches 1 at 82%, i.e. ~180 ms of the 220 ms clock and 0.93 of the travel. The
       last visible frame still carries most of the motion, so nothing pops, and the
       remaining 40 ms is too short to read as a pause.

     Measured through AnimationSet#getTransformationAt (the Shell's own path), with the
     paired slide curve:
         progress   alpha   travel
         0.02       0.995   0.014
         0.10       0.945   0.094
         0.20       0.820   0.238
         0.30       0.634   0.403
         0.40       0.394   0.561
         0.50       0.238   0.700
         0.60       0.132   0.785
         0.80       0.005   0.920
         0.82       0.000   0.938

     PathInterpolator contract: the path starts at (0,0), ends at (1,1) and x is
     strictly increasing (0.12 -> 0.26 -> 0.42 -> 0.58 -> 0.72 -> 0.85 -> 0.92 -> 1). -->
<pathInterpolator xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:pathData="M0,0 C0.10,0.02 0.24,0.24 0.40,0.68 C0.54,0.90 0.66,0.99 0.72,1 C0.82,1 1,1 1,1" />
